            "review_title": "Review at Phap Hoa Quan 1",
            "review_text": "Royal B\nMendooran, Australia532 contributions\n1\nThe best vego food I have found in Ho Chi Minh City so far. Really excellent.\nFeb 2016 • Solo\nSo I hopped on a random guys bike and asked him to take me to a good \"Com Chay\" restaurant. He pulled up at this place, sure enough it said Com Chay.... \n\nI got a mixed plate and it was all texturally and taste wise excellent. I was charged 15000 dong, or less than $1 AUD for the plate. Seriously good, going back for dinner. \n\nI am a picky diner, and find fault when it is there. There was none.! The table condiments included fresh or crushed chilli and sauces. All good. \n\nFantastic.\nRead more\nWritten February 6, 2016",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
