            "review_title": "Review at Phap Hoa Quan 1",
            "review_text": "jose-olay\nKandy, Sri Lanka13 contributions\n0\nDelicious and so cheap!\nJun 2015 • Solo\nI found this place which is located close to my hotel. When I walked in the ladies didn't want to serve me, as I guess none of them spoke good English. This was however pretty funny and I'm not sure what I ordered. I just pointed at what looked good, and it certainly was. \nThe food was really delicious with great spices and was a real authentic Vietnamese restaurant which was busy the whole time I was in there.\nRead more\nWritten June 19, 2015",
