            "review_title": "Review at Phap Hoa Quan 1",
            "review_text": "danny t\nkuala lumpur25 contributions\n0\nOne of my favorite vegetarian restaurant in HCM\nApr 2015 • Solo\nThis small restaurant is one of my most frequent place when I need to have a light vegetarian meal. They offer a vegetarian buffet lunch where you can pick and choose array of dishes. Their eggplant, banana plant and curry tofu is delicious. They also offer a la carte vegetarian dishes lunch and dinner. The one I normally order are noodle soup and fry noodle / rice. Sitting is normal height but without back support. Most important it is located centrally just opposite the Pham Ngo Lau bus station.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten May 18, 2015",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
