            "review_title": "Review at Phap Hoa Quan 1",
            "review_text": "Jepa P\nJarvenpaa, Finland262 contributions\n0\nInexpensive, popular lunch spot\nFeb 2014 • Couples\nNear the tourist ghetto, this inexpensive popular lunch spot vegan restaurant is filled with local office workers. They do not speak english here, but just go in and point the foods in vitrine. Price was 33000 dong per person. There were many different mock meat and mock fish dishes, \"tuna\" salad, boiled greens, summer rolls and desserts available. Food was tasty and filling. You get to share the table with locals. So nice! Recommended!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 10, 2014",
